 class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/17d93e7fdc27fe407f3e1f024777428f.poster.avif?t=1783201048\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/17d93e7fdc27fe407f3e1f024777428f.webm?t=1783201048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/17d93e7fdc27fe407f3e1f024777428f.mp4?t=1783201048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Tools -</strong> Buy Team Upgrades Using your Cash You Acquire From Selling Logs Such As Speed Boost And Tool Upgrades<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/88399d858ce6557c633e9cc92f8e190e.poster.avif?t=1783201048\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/88399d858ce6557c633e9cc92f8e190e.webm?t=1783201048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/88399d858ce6557c633e9cc92f8e190e.mp4?t=1783201048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work Together</strong> - Work as a team to clear the forest and avoid the wildlife who aren't friendly (And Have A Fun Time!)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/ab02aaefa607e5097682b24d218613bd.poster.avif?t=1783201048\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4313610/extras/ab02aaefa607e5097682b24d218613bd.webm